title: 'Staking: Chill stakers should not have a score'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    `ScoreProvider::score` now returns `None` for a bonded stash that is neither a nominator nor
    a validator, matching `pallet-staking-async`. `pallet-bags-list` can no longer re-insert a
    chilled staker into `VoterList` through `rebag` or the `on_idle` auto-rebag. A chilled staker
    already in `VoterList` is removed on its next `rebag` or auto-rebag.
crates:
- name: pallet-staking
  bump: patch
